==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|nítján}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*newuntehun}}.

===Numeral===
'''nítján'''

# '''[[nineteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[átján#Icelandic|átján]] and before [[tuttugu#Icelandic|tuttugu]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[nítjándi]] {{g|m}}, [[nítjánda]] {{g|f|n}}.

